### GET All Contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/api/contacts
Accept: application/json

### GET Contact by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/contacts/64f123abc123
Accept: application/json

### POST Create Contact
POST http://localhost:3000/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@email.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Blue",
  "birthday": "1995-01-01"
}

### PUT Update Contact
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/contacts/PASTE_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "jane.smith@email.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Green",
  "birthday": "1995-01-01"
}

### DELETE Contact
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/contacts/PASTE_ID_HERE